<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>9.10.6: Vertex Form and Coordinates of the Vertex</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02507</md:content-id>
    <md:title>9.10.6: Vertex Form and Coordinates of the Vertex</md:title>
    <md:uuid>2567ae95-3eab-4e9e-8841-ab66a3884838</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
    <section class="numbered-exercises" id="sect-00001"><title>Cool Down</title>
      <exercise id="exer-00001">
        <problem id="prob-00001">
          <para id="para-00001">A quadratic function is defined by the expression <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
          <para id="para-00002">Rewrite the expression in <term class="glossary-tooltip" id="term-00001">vertex form (of a quadratic expression)</term> and give the coordinates of the <term class="glossary-tooltip" id="term-00002">vertex (of a graph)</term>. Show your reasoning.</para>
          <para id="para-00003">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00001">
          <para id="para-00004">Compare your answer:</para>
          <para id="para-00005"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>81</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>. The vertex is at <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>81</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
          <para id="para-00006"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00007"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>100</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>19</m:mn><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>100</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00008"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>100</m:mn><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>81</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00009"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>81</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></solution>
      </exercise>
    </section>
  </content>
</document>